          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p
            Origin of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/effective+field+theory"} effective field theory
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mesons"} mesons
            in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nuclear+physics"} nuclear physics
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hidden+local+gauge+symmetry"} hidden local gauge symmetry
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jun+John+Sakurai"}> Jun John Sakurai
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Theory of strong interactions
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/3218"} spire:3218
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0003-4916(60)90126-3"} doi:10.1016/0003-4916(60)90126-3
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Masako+Bando"}> Masako Bando
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Taichiro+Kugo"} Taichiro Kugo
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Nonlinear realization and hidden local symmetries
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-1573(88)90019-1"} doi:10.1016/0370-1573(88)90019-1
            %li
              %p
                Yong-Liang Ma, Masayasu Harada, Section 6 of:
                %em Lecture notes on the Skyrme model
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1604.04850"}> arXiv:1604.04850
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/1448311"} spire:1448311
              %p
                (in relation to
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmions"} Skyrmions
          %p Further original articles:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Masako+Bando"}> Masako Bando
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Taichiro+Kugo"} Taichiro Kugo
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Is the
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi ρ
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \rho
                    Meson a Dynamical Gauge Boson of Hidden Local Symmetry?
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.54.1215"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.54.1215
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Masako+Bando"}> Masako Bando
                , Takanori Fujiwara, Koichi Yamawaki,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Generalized Hidden Local Symmetry and the
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi A
                            %mn 1
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A_1
                    Meson
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1143/PTP.79.1140"} doi:10.1143/PTP.79.1140
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Howard+Georgi"}> Howard Georgi
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Vector realization of chiral symmetry
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(90)90210-5"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(90)90210-5
          %p
            Equivalence between
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hidden+local+symmetry"} hidden local symmetry
            = succeed "-description" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+Yang-Mills+theory"} massive Yang-Mills theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmion"} Skyrmion
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+hadrodynamics"} quantum hadrodynamics
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atsushi+Hosaka"}> Atsushi Hosaka
              , H. Toki, W. Weise,
              %em
                Skyrme Solitons With Vector Mesons: Equivalence of the Massive Yang-Mills and Hidden Local Symmetry Scheme, 1988, Z. Phys. A332 (1989) 97-102 (
                %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/24079"}> spire:24079
                )
          %p
            In view of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chiral+anomaly"} chiral anomaly
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/WZW+term"} WZW term
          %ul
            %li
              Michio Hashimoto,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Hidden Local Symmetry for Anomalous Processes with Isospin/
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi SU
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mn 3
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SU(3)
                  Breaking Effects
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-ph/9605422"} arXiv:hep-ph/9605422
          %p
            With emphasis on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmions"} Skyrmions
            involving
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+mesons"} vector mesons
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Yong-Liang Ma, Ghil-Seok Yang, Yongseok Oh, Masayasu Harada,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Skyrmions with vector mesons in the hidden local symmetry approach
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1209.3554"} arXiv:1209.3554
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mannque+Rho"}> Mannque Rho
                ,
                %em Skyrmions and Fractional Quantum Hall Droplets Unified by Hidden Symmetries in Dense Matter
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2109.10059"}> arXiv:2109.10059
                )
          %div
            %h3#ReferencesHadronsAsKKModesOf5dYangMillsTheory Hadrons as KK-modes of 5d Yang-Mills theory
            %p
              The suggestion that the tower of observed
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+mesons"} vector mesons
              – when regarded as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+fields"} gauge fields
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hidden+local+symmetry"} hidden local symmetries
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chiral+perturbation+theory"} chiral perturbation theory
              – is reasonably modeled as a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+theory"} Kaluza-Klein tower
              of
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D5+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=5 Yang-Mills theory
            %ul
              %li#SonStephanov03
                D. T. Son, M. A. Stephanov,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em QCD and dimensional deconstruction
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-ph/0304182"} arXiv:hep-ph/0304182
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.69.065020"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.69.065020
            %p
              That the pure
              = succeed "-" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pion"} pion
              = succeed "-model" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmion"} Skyrmion
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/baryons"} baryons
              is approximately the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+theory"} KK-reduction
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
              in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D5+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=5 Yang-Mills theory
              is already due to:
            %ul
              %li#AtiyahManton89
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicholas+Manton"} Nicholas Manton
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Skyrmions from instantons
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(89)90340-7"} doi:10.1016/0370-2693(89)90340-7
            %p
              with a
              = succeed "-variant" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hyperbolic+space"} hyperbolic space
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Sutcliffe"} Paul Sutcliffe
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Skyrmions, instantons, mass and curvature
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0411052"} arXiv:hep-th/0411052
            %p Further discussion of this approximation:
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Josh+Cork"}> Josh Cork
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Halcrow"} Chris Halcrow
                %em ADHM skyrmions
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.15190"}> arXiv:2110.15190
                )
            %p
              The observation that the result of
              %a{:href => "#AtiyahManton89"} Atiyah-Manton 89
              becomes an exact
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+theory"} Kaluza-Klein construction
              of
              = succeed "/" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmions"} Skyrmions
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/baryons"} baryons
              from
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D5+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=5
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
              when the full
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+theory"} KK-tower
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+mesons"} vector mesons
              as in
              %a{:href => "#SonStephanov03"} Son-Stephanov 03
              is included into the Skyrmion model (see also
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "skyrmion#ReferencesSkyrmeHadrodynamicsWithVectorMesons"} there
            %ul
              %li#Sutcliffe10
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Sutcliffe"}> Paul Sutcliffe
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Skyrmions, instantons and holography
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1003.0023"} arXiv:1003.0023
              %li#Sutcliffe15
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Sutcliffe"}> Paul Sutcliffe
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Holographic Skyrmions
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/1383608"} spire:1383608
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0217984915400515"} doi:10.1142/S0217984915400515
            %p
              In the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sakai-Sugimoto+model"} Sakai-Sugimoto model
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+QCD"} holographic QCD
              the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D5+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=5 Yang-Mills theory
              of this
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hadron+Kaluza-Klein+theory"} hadron Kaluza-Klein theory
              is identified with the
              = succeed "-theory" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
              = succeed "-" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-brane"} D8
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flavour+branes"} flavour branes
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D4%2FD8-brane+intersection"} intersected with D4-branes
              in an
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+model"} intersecting D-brane model
            %ul
              %li#SakaiSugimoto04
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tadakatsu+Sakai"}> Tadakatsu Sakai
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"} Shigeki Sugimoto
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Low energy hadron physics in holographic QCD
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0412141"} arXiv:hep-th/0412141
              %li#SakaiSugimoto05
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tadakatsu+Sakai"}> Tadakatsu Sakai
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"} Shigeki Sugimoto
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em More on a holographic dual of QCD
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0507073"} arXiv:hep-th/0507073
              %li#HSSY07
                %p
                  Hiroyuki Hata,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tadakatsu+Sakai"} Tadakatsu Sakai
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"} Shigeki Sugimoto
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Baryons from instantons in holographic QCD
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0701280"} arXiv:hep-th/0701280
              %li#BolognesiSutcliffe13
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefano+Bolognesi"}> Stefano Bolognesi
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Sutcliffe"} Paul Sutcliffe
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em The Sakai-Sugimoto soliton
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1309.1396"} arXiv:1309.1396
              %li#Bartolini17
                %p
                  Lorenzo Bartolini,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefano+Bolognesi"} Stefano Bolognesi
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em From the Sakai-Sugimoto Model to the Generalized Skyrme Model
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.03873"} arXiv:1711.03873
            %p
              Extensive review of this
              = succeed "/" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+QCD"} holographic
              = succeed "-realization" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+theory"} KK-theoretic
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+hadrodynamics"} quantum hadrodynamics
              from
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D5+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=5 Yang-Mills theory
              is in:
            %ul
              %li#RhoEtAl16
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mannque+Rho"}> Mannque Rho
                  ,
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ismail+Zahed"} Ismail Zahed
                  (eds.)
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+Multifaceted+Skyrmion"} The Multifaceted Skyrmion
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/9710"} doi:10.1142/9710
                %ul
                  %li#Sugimoto16
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"}> Shigeki Sugimoto
                    ,
                    = succeed "," do
                      %em Skyrmion and String theory
                    = succeed "," do
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mannque+Rho"} Mannque Rho
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ismail+Zahed"} Ismail Zahed
                    (eds.)
                    = succeed "," do
                      %em
                        %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+Multifaceted+Skyrmion"} The Multifaceted Skyrmion
                    = succeed ")" do
                      %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/9710"} doi:10.1142/9710
            %p
              Via the realization of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D4%2FD8+brane+bound+states"} D4/D8 brane bound states
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
              in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-brane"} D8-brane
              = succeed "-theory" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
              %a{:href => "DpDpPlus4BraneBoundState#AsYangMillsInstantons"} there
              and
              = succeed ")," do
                %a{:href => "D4-D8+brane+bound+state#AsInstantonsOnTheD8Brane"} there
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/baryons"} baryons
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wrapped+brane"} wrapped
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D4-branes"} D4-branes
            %ul
              %li#Witten98b
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Baryons And Branes In Anti de Sitter Space
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9805112"} arXiv:hep-th/9805112
              %li#GrossOoguri98
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Gross"}> David Gross
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hirosi+Ooguri"} Hirosi Ooguri
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      Aspects of Large
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi N
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N
                      Gauge Theory Dynamics as Seen by String Theory
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9805129"} arXiv:hep-th/9805129
            %p
              and further developed in the
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nuclear+matrix+model"} nuclear matrix model
            %ul
              %li#HashimotoIizukaYi10
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Koji+Hashimoto"}> Koji Hashimoto
                  , Norihiro Iizuka, Piljin Yi,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em A Matrix Model for Baryons and Nuclear Forces
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1003.4988"} arXiv:1003.4988
              %li
                %p
                  Si-wen Li, Tuo Jia,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Matrix model and Holographic Baryons in the D0-D4 background
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.00068"} arXiv:1506.00068
              %li#HashimotoMatsuoMorita19
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Koji+Hashimoto"}> Koji Hashimoto
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yoshinori+Matsuo"} Yoshinori Matsuo
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Takeshi+Morita"} Takeshi Morita
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Nuclear states and spectra in holographic QCD
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.07444"} arXiv:1902.07444
              %li
                %p
                  Yasuhiro Hayashi, Takahiro Ogino,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tadakatsu+Sakai"} Tadakatsu Sakai
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"} Shigeki Sugimoto
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Stringy excited baryons in holographic QCD
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.01461"} arXiv:2001.01461
            %p
              In relation to
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang-Mills+monopoles"} Yang-Mills monopoles
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefano+Bolognesi"}> Stefano Bolognesi
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Solitons, Large
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N
                    and Holography
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Bolognesi_SolitonsHolography.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %p
              Discussion, in this context, of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-term"} D-term
              effects affecting
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hadron"} hadron
              stability:
            %ul
              %li
                Mitsutoshi Fujita, Yoshitaka Hatta,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"} Shigeki Sugimoto
                %em Nucleon D-term in holographic QCD
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.06578"} arXiv:2206.06578
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
            %p
              More on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/baryons"} baryons
              in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sakai-Sugimoto+model"} Sakai-Sugimoto model
              of
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+QCD"} holographic QCD
            %ul
              %li
                Salvatore Baldino, Lorenzo Bartolini,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefano+Bolognesi"} Stefano Bolognesi
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sven+Bjarke+Gudnason"} Sven Bjarke Gudnason
                %em Holographic Nuclear Physics with Massive Quarks
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.00680"}> arXiv:2102.00680
                )
            %p
              More on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mesons"} mesons
              in
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+QCD"} holographic QCD
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Johanna+Erdmenger"}> Johanna Erdmenger
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nick+Evans"} Nick Evans
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ingo+Kirsch"} Ingo Kirsch
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ed+Threlfall"} Ed Threlfall
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Mesons in Gauge/Gravity Duals - A Review
                  %strong 35
                  (2008) 81-133 &amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0711.4467"}> arXiv:0711.4467
                  ,
                  = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1140/epja/i2007-10540-1"} doi:10.1140/epja/i2007-10540-1
              %li
                %p
                  Daniel Ávila, Leonardo Patiño,
                  %em Melting holographic mesons by cooling a magnetized quark gluon plasma
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.02470"}> arXiv:2002.02470
                  )
              %li
                %p
                  Xuanmin Cao, Hui Liu, Danning Li,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Pion quasiparticles and QCD phase transitions at finite temperature and isospin density from holography
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.00289"} arXiv:2009.00289
              %li
                %p
                  Xuanmin Cao, Songyu Qiu, Hui Liu, Danning Li,
                  %em Thermal properties of light mesons from holography
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.10946"}> arXiv:2102.10946
                  )
              %li
                %p
                  Artur Amorim, Miguel S. Costa, Matti Järvinen,
                  %em Regge theory in a Holographic dual of QCD in the Veneziano Limit
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.11296"}> arXiv:2102.11296
                  )
              %li#daRocha21
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rold%C3%A3o+da+Rocha"}> Roldão da Rocha
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Information in AdS/QCD: mass spectroscopy of isovector mesons
                  %strong 103
                  106027 (2021) &amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.03924"}> arXiv:2103.03924
                  ,
                  = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.103.106027"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.103.106027
              %li
                %p
                  Shahin Mamedov, Narmin Nasibova,
                  %em
                    Temperature dependence of
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi ρ
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \rho
                    meson-nucleon coupling constant from the soft-wall model
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.10494"}> arXiv:2103.10494
                  )
            %p
              An alternative scenario of derivation of 4d
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmions"} Skyrmions
              by
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
              of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D5+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=5 Yang-Mills theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+interval"} closed interval
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
              instead of by
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D4%2FD8-brane+intersections"} D4/D8-brane intersections
              as in the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sakai-Sugimoto+model"} Sakai-Sugimoto model
            %ul
              %li#IvanovaLechtenfeldPopov18
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tatiana+Ivanova"}> Tatiana Ivanova
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Olaf+Lechtenfeld"} Olaf Lechtenfeld
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Popov"} Alexander Popov
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Skyrme model from 6d
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi 𝒩
                          %mo =
